/* Xen Scale Preview: host app strings (iOS and macOS). Keys are shared; unused ones are harmless. */
"Quick Look previews for Scala scale files (.scl): a pitch wheel, a one-period keyboard, the degrees and the source." = "为 Scala 音阶文件（.scl）提供 Quick Look 预览：音高轮、一个周期的键盘、音级和源文件。";
"Open a scale in Files, Mail or Messages and tap it, or press and hold and choose Preview. The extension runs on its own, so you can close this app." = "在“文件”“邮件”或“信息”中打开音阶并轻点，或长按后选择“预览”。扩展会独立运行，因此可以关闭此 App。";
"If a file still opens as plain text, make sure no other app has claimed .scl, then reinstall this app." = "如果文件仍以纯文本打开，请确认没有其他 App 占用了 .scl，然后重新安装此 App。";
"Open…" = "打开…";
"File type: %@" = "文件类型：%@";
"Quick Look previews for Scala scale files (.scl). Select one in Finder and press Space." = "为 Scala 音阶文件（.scl）提供 Quick Look 预览。在访达中选择文件并按空格键。";
"Quick Look extension is registered" = "Quick Look 扩展已注册";
"Quick Look extension is not registered yet" = "Quick Look 扩展尚未注册";
"You can quit this app now. Keep it installed, though: the extension lives inside it. If previews don't appear, turn on “Xen Scale Preview” under Quick Look in System Settings › Extensions, then click Reset Quick Look." = "现在可以退出此 App，但请保持安装：扩展包含在其中。如果没有显示预览，请在“系统设置”›“扩展”的 Quick Look 中打开“Xen Scale Preview”，然后点按“重置 Quick Look”。";
"Extension Settings…" = "扩展设置…";
"Reset Quick Look" = "重置 Quick Look";
"Quit" = "退出";
"Open File…" = "打开文件…";
"Open Folder…" = "打开文件夹…";
"Close" = "关闭";
"Folder" = "文件夹";
"Refresh" = "刷新";
"Choose a folder to browse its scales." = "选择文件夹以浏览其中的音阶。";
"No scale files (.scl) in this folder." = "此文件夹中没有 .scl 文件。";
"Open a scale file or a folder, or drop one here." = "打开音阶文件或文件夹，或将其拖到此处。";
